ng for that,\n\n00:01:10.421 --> 00:01:11.460\nand look what happened.\n\n00:01:11.461 --> 00:01:15.800\nShe got arrested and is now facing two felony counts for it.\n\n00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:16.540\nSo it's like\n\n00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:20.220\nwhen you're in the heat of a Moment or an interaction or something like that.\n\n00:01:20.221 --> 00:01:22.860\nTalk to a friend, talk to your parents.\n\n00:01:22.861 --> 00:01:27.020\nLook up and research. Know what you're getting into before you post something,\n\n00:01:27.021 --> 00:01:30.320\nbecause once you post it, there's no taking it back.\n\n00:01:30.321 --> 00:01:33.100\nSo as we get any more new information on this case,\n\n00:01:33.101 --> 00:01:36.100\nI will let you know. Or if the guy is arrested or charged,\n\n00:01:36.101 --> 00:01:37.700\nI will let you know as well.\n\n00:01:37.701 --> 00:01:38.220\nBut, yes,\n\n00:01:38.221 --> 00:01:42.360\nas of now, Olivia Henderson is facing two felony charges.\n"
